---
// about.astro - Your Professional Profile Page
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Me | Entry-Level Software Engineer">
	<div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 32px; padding: 24px 0;">
		
		<section style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; border-b: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding-bottom: 24px;">
			<h1 style="font-size: 36px; font-weight: 800;">About Me</h1>
			<p style="font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; opacity: 0.8;">
				I am an enthusiastic entry-level software engineer and fresher based in Hyderabad, deeply passionate about application architecture and technical systems. I focus on building cleanly structured applications while keeping security best practices in mind.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px;">
			<h2 style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #3B82F6;">Core Competencies & Education</h2>
			<div style="background-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.05); border-left: 4px solid #3B82F6; padding: 16px; border-radius: 4px;">
				<h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px;">Technical Academic Background</h3>
				<p style="line-height: 1.6; opacity: 0.9;">
					Actively pursuing foundational development skills with an emphasis on role-based software designs and structured database management.
				</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px;">
			<h2 style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700;">Key Technical Projects</h2>
			
			<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; padding-left: 8px;">
				<div style="border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.3); padding-bottom: 12px;">
					<h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;">Full-Stack Record & Access System</h3>
					<p style="font-size: 15px; opacity: 0.8; margin-top: 4px; line-height: 1.5;">
						Developed a centralized data-lookup module featuring role-based dashboard security constraints and an organized admin environment for data accuracy.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
			<h2 style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700;">Interests & Growth</h2>
			<p style="line-height: 1.6; opacity: 0.8;">
				Beyond standard application programming, I am highly interested in how system infrastructure secures user identities. I spend my spare time following structural systems design patterns and tracking foundational technology concepts.
			</p>
		</section>

	</div>
</Layout>